{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/9199a40b1ba66e2e4ff92f225289c32a.avif?t=1765442743\" width=1528 height=2466 /></span>What\u2019s that? It\u2019s a <strong>boomer shooter</strong> infused with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, stunning <strong>frame-by-frame animations</strong>, and vibrant <strong>pseudo-3D graphics</strong> that push the limits of speed and intensity! Step into the chaotic world of <strong>Bullet Knight</strong>, where every moment is a thrilling ride filled with adrenaline and action. Experience lightning-fast combat that keeps you on your toes as you dodge, shoot, and slash your way through relentless waves of enemies while navigating the unpredictable terrain of the <strong>Middleworld</strong>. Enhance, upgrade, and modify the <strong>Bullet Knight</strong> to become stronger, more cunning, and faster, adding a touch of bloodthirstiness to your arsenal as you unlock powerful abilities and unique weapon modifications tailored to your playstyle. Enjoy beautifully crafted animations that bring each character and enemy to life, adding depth and fluidity to the combat experience. Venture into the <strong>Middleworld</strong>, a realm designed as the ultimate playground for gods, where competition and entertainment reign supreme. Face off against formidable bosses that will test your skills and strategy, granting you powerful upgrades and revealing secrets about this enigmatic land. Are you ready to embrace the chaos and prove your worth in the arena of the gods? Join the fight now and dive into a world where speed meets strategy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709990?t=1765442743","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/364467af19df3cd5b1ffb31f39004f2a2f191ce4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765442743",