and enemy to life, adding depth and fluidity to the combat experience. Venture into the <strong>Middleworld</strong>, a realm designed as the ultimate playground for gods, where competition and entertainment reign supreme. Face off against formidable bosses that will test your skills and strategy, granting you powerful upgrades and revealing secrets about this enigmatic land. Are you ready to embrace the chaos and prove your worth in the arena of the gods? Join the fight now and dive into a world where speed meets strategy!</p>","developers":["JAKALWIZARDSTUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/8cd0a0aa7618a59f33ae01548e044a6f189e5bfd/header.jpg?t=1765442743","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709990/1826595742/091cb5ee4d917b963f31e30ca1a96f8bf735fb07/1758983061/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758984127","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709990/1826595742/091cb5ee4d917b963f31e30ca1a96f8bf735fb07/1758983061/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758984127","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709990/1826595742/091cb5ee4d917b963f31e30ca1a96f8bf735fb07/1758983061/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758984127","id":257207428,"name":"Demo's gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207428/a86058d70191007b145e35ef43cae040f394b115/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758984127"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709990/295537374/e912845f6071fc52f0ddfc68163798bb23d91286/1750427725/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748672214","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709990/295537374/e912845f6071fc52f0ddfc68163798bb23d91286/1750427725/dash_h264.mpd?t=17486